{"id":"competencia","lemma":"competencia","pos":"noun","rank":1728,"glosses":["competence, expertise","jurisdiction, purview","competition"],"ipa":"/kompeˈtenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"competencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-competencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"La competencia es ardua.","en":"The competition is fierce.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519456"},{"text":"Sus competencias le capacitaron para el puesto.","en":"His skills qualified him for the job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705617"},{"text":"La competencia te hace mejor.","en":"Competition makes you better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526850"},{"text":"Tom tiene un armario lleno de trofeos que ganó en competencias.","en":"Tom has a closet full of trophies that he won at competitions."},{"text":"La competencia puede ocasionar fatiga.","en":"Competition can cause fatigue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508915"}]}